msgctxt "92"
msgid "What're you going to do about the eviction?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"My husband says he doesn't care how much money they offer us. He's not going"
" to leave his childhood home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Mine, too. We don't want to be moving at our age. I couldn't live in some "
"big apartment building where you don't even know your own neighbors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Did you hear about Kume-san? He agreed to sell his house."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"He said he's taking this opportunity to move in with his son's family. I "
"guess they have a place on the mainland."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "Really? It's going to be lonely around here without him."
msgstr ""

